# Smart Parking demo. Needs the "REST Client" extension in VS Code.
# Click "Send Request" above each request, top to bottom, on a fresh start.

@gw = http://localhost:8000

### 1. Gateway is up
GET {{gw}}/health

### 2. Users: list the sample user
GET {{gw}}/users

### 3. Users: register a new driver (gets id 2)
POST {{gw}}/users
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Ali", "email": "ali@example.com" }

### 4. Users: same email again is rejected (409)
POST {{gw}}/users
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Copy", "email": "ali@example.com" }

### 5. Parking: list all spaces
GET {{gw}}/spaces

### 6. Parking: admin adds a new space (gets id 4)
POST {{gw}}/spaces
Content-Type: application/json

{ "location": "Airport", "pricePerHour": 15 }

### 7. Parking: only available spaces
GET {{gw}}/spaces/available

### 8. Reservation: Sara books space 1 for 2 hours (amount 20)
POST {{gw}}/reservations
Content-Type: application/json

{ "userId": 1, "spaceId": 1, "hours": 2 }

### 9. Reservation: Ali tries the same space, double booking is blocked (409)
POST {{gw}}/reservations
Content-Type: application/json

{ "userId": 2, "spaceId": 1, "hours": 1 }

### 10. Parking: space 1 is no longer available
GET {{gw}}/spaces/available

### 11. Payment: pay reservation 1
POST {{gw}}/payments
Content-Type: application/json

{ "reservationId": 1 }

### 12. Payment: paying twice is rejected (409)
POST {{gw}}/payments
Content-Type: application/json

{ "reservationId": 1 }

### 13. Reservation 1 is now "paid"
GET {{gw}}/reservations/1

### 14. Reservation: Ali books space 2 for 3 hours (reservation 2)
POST {{gw}}/reservations
Content-Type: application/json

{ "userId": 2, "spaceId": 2, "hours": 3 }

### 15. Reservation: cancel reservation 2
POST {{gw}}/reservations/2/cancel

### 16. Parking: space 2 is available again
GET {{gw}}/spaces/available

### 17. Reservation: a paid reservation cannot be cancelled (409)
POST {{gw}}/reservations/1/cancel

### 18. Security: marking paid without paying is blocked at the gateway (403)
POST {{gw}}/reservations/2/paid

### 19. Security: freeing someone's space is blocked at the gateway (403)
POST {{gw}}/spaces/1/release

### 20. Gateway: unknown route (404)
GET {{gw}}/hello

### 21. All payments
GET {{gw}}/payments

### 22. Resilience: run "docker compose stop parking-service" first, then send this (503)
GET {{gw}}/spaces
